title: "WebCode Sonification Engine"
abstract: "An open-source experimental browser extension for transforming webpage computational structure into deterministic and generative music. A webpage's accessible computational structure may define a reproducible generative musical identity."
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-07-05
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/kakon77777-commits/webcode-sonification-engine"
url: "https://wse.evemisstechnology.com/"
authors:
  - name: "Neo.K (EveMissLab)"
    email: "kakon77777@gmail.com"
keywords:
  - sonification
  - generative music
  - browser extension
  - web audio
  - HTML sonification
  - deterministic music generation
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Synesthesia Add-on: a Tool for HTML Sonification"
    conference:
      name: "Brazilian Symposium on Computer Music"
    year: 2017
    repository-code: "https://github.com/rppbodo/synesthesia-addon"
    notes: "Prior art, gratefully acknowledged: HTML pages treated as musical scores in a browser add-on. WSE was designed independently but thanks this pioneer work for establishing feasibility."
